3. Methods (no code copied)
---------------------------

  - Tango, T. (1998). Equivalence test and confidence interval for the
    difference in proportions for the paired-sample design. Statistics in
    Medicine 17, 891-908. (Paired score interval in noninferiority.py.)
  - McNemar's exact test; paired Wald interval. (Textbook methods.)
  - Dao et al., FlashAttention (2022): the online-softmax algorithm.
  - Model architectures (PaliGemma/Gemma pi0.5, NVIDIA GR00T N1.7) are
    re-implemented from their checkpoint layouts; no model code is vendored.
    Checkpoint weights keep their own licences and are never bundled.


